[Name] GLib
[Summary] Low-level core library (glib-2.0)
[Description] GLib is the low-level core library that forms the basis of GTK and GNOME. Bumped from 2.63.5 to 2.84.4 for the GNOME 48 stack (Mutter 48.7, GTK 4.18, libadwaita 1.8, etc.). Most invasive build in the chain because every other library links it; will replace the ISO's 2.63.5 once installed via SymlinkProgram. Needs meson >= 1.3 (handled by Alien-PIP3 install in step_tools). Track: ~/.claude/projects/-home-nohearth-Projects-BuildLiveCD/memory/pantheon-stack-port.md
